# Never ship environment files into an image (CLAUDE §11); only .env.example is allowed.
**/.env*
!**/.env.example
# Key material and certificates (docs/runbooks/deploy-oracle.md): never in an image.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/secrets
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
# Incremental TypeScript state from a developer machine would confuse the image build.
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.idea
.mail-preview
docs
docs_temp
e2e
